                        "form": "welsprekenders"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                        "entry_id": "c0a694ba-5032-3515-8330-22e60012848b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "goed, overtuigend en meeslepend (in het openbaar) kunnen spreken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03a2e137-7e77-42a4-9d3d-0513ff58b699",
                                "sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                                "text": "SGP-fractievoorzitter Kees van der Staaij is de beste spreker van de Tweede Kamer. Hij kreeg donderdagavond de Thorbeckeprijs voor politieke welsprekendheid uitgereikt door de voorzitter van de Tweede Kamer, Khadija Arib."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4404983-085d-4a1f-a550-85a0d1887c7e",
                                "sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                                "text": "Een paar jaar geleden stond Moszkowicz nog op grote hoogte. Hij was bekend als de advocaat die met grote doses flair, durf en welsprekendheid tal van zware jongens bijstond: van 'Hakkelaar'Johan V. tot de Surinaamse legerleider Desi Bouterse. In de zaak-Holleeder kwam hij weliswaar in de problemen, maar met de succesvolle verdediging van PVV-leider Geert Wilders revancheerde hij zich."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e157216-c249-3965-ac2d-edc24408d519",
                        "entry_id": "c0a694ba-5032-3515-8330-22e60012848b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het fraai, overtuigend en meeslepend kunnen brengen van een boodschap ongeacht de manier waarop"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5a93226-babe-44b9-aa28-745fa0e78e3c",
                                "sense_id": "6e157216-c249-3965-ac2d-edc24408d519",
                                "text": "Animaties verbeelden zijn emoties en herinneringen op een poëtische manier en blijken in veel gevallen welsprekender dan de kaper zelf. Toch werpen de makers juist door de combinatie van deze beelden een nieuw licht op het piratenprobleem. Hun aanpak beperkt zich niet tot film: op lasthijack.com zorgen zij vanuit verschillende perspectieven voor nog meer doortekening."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "871094e5-c615-4f13-ab9b-b9d0f24cb151",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a694ba-5032-3515-8330-22e60012848b",
                        "source_sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                        "target_lang_word": "eloquent",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eloquent",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "434ee677-0be9-35bd-9687-39f641b64d9d",
                                        "entry_id": "361e7739-6f76-3905-b4fc-f10ba25fafef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fluently persuasive and articulate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f9e3cb9-c43a-4740-8361-93e056f2f0fe",
                                                "sense_id": "434ee677-0be9-35bd-9687-39f641b64d9d",
                                                "text": "an eloquent writer"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b934f5da-20dd-370a-9644-68e9d639d96d",
                                        "entry_id": "361e7739-6f76-3905-b4fc-f10ba25fafef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Effective in expressing meaning by speech."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d4e2e24-3863-4e5f-8da8-d03eec2f37aa",
                                                "sense_id": "b934f5da-20dd-370a-9644-68e9d639d96d",
                                                "text": "an eloquent article"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "362e174c-43c6-34e9-b874-7fee4a3ce618",
                                        "entry_id": "361e7739-6f76-3905-b4fc-f10ba25fafef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to areas in the brain that serve an identifiable neurological function, in which injury leads to focal deficits or disability."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "043a9b42-11fe-4dd9-a50d-5b92fdaf81fc",
                                                "sense_id": "362e174c-43c6-34e9-b874-7fee4a3ce618",
                                                "text": "Lydiard was diagnosed shortly after new year following speech disturbance and subtle memory issues. He has a high-grade glioma, an aggressive malignant primary brain tumour in the left side. It is in the “eloquent brain”, very close to the part that controls speech, and would have been considered untreatable in the past."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "113a95a2-ccff-480c-a6c9-3f052b89297a",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a694ba-5032-3515-8330-22e60012848b",
                        "source_sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                        "target_lang_word": "silver-tongued",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silver-tongued",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                        "entry_id": "83fc3186-d3c0-31c3-8349-0ad5bdd07ed0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Articulate and charming in speech; eloquent; also, having a pleasant-sounding voice or way of speaking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0952c3ac-b76c-4487-a40c-997e3c514a6b",
                                                "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                                "text": "silver-tongued devil"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7630696-941d-40ee-8e67-fa0e1837768d",
                                                "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                                "text": "Siluer tongu'd Smith whoſe well tun'd ſtile hath made thy death the generall teares of the Muſes, queintlie couldſt thou deuiſe heauenly Ditties to Apollos Lute, and teach ſtately verſe to trip it as ſmoothly, as if Ouid and thou had but one ſoule."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24d64f1d-8372-42b6-b75c-cb160f746551",
                                                "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                                "text": "Mr. [Thomas] Parker ſoon became a pleader at the bar; travelled the Midland circuit; acquired additional eſteem, buſineſs, and property; vvas denominated the Silver-tongued Counſel; and found intereſt enough, in 1705, to cauſe himſelf to be returned a member for the borough, vvith Lord James Cavendiſh, ſon to the firſt Duke of Devonſhire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3612a5e-f466-4c91-bd23-127357a8ebc6",
                                                "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                                "text": "[T]he statesman, whose inward feelings had at first so much impeded his efforts to make himself known, had now regained all the ease and fluency of a silver-tongued lawyer of the very highest order."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21dd8142-943b-429b-91b1-9e4f7489fa4f",
                                                "sense_id": "546c4c91-5a30-3587-92c9-71f3632f5c0c",
                                                "text": "Philips—Sergeant Gerheim's black, silver-tongued House Mouse—is telling everybody about the one thousand cherries he has busted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0401bbc2-9d6c-469d-be96-211aa6a43ff2",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a694ba-5032-3515-8330-22e60012848b",
                        "source_sense_id": "c96b7d03-32aa-3631-86dd-cc68f7487449",
                        "target_lang_word": "well-spoken",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "well-spoken",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8771c5b-b5d1-3169-856f-89ca85404c1c",
                                        "entry_id": "da02bda9-84c7-3632-8cd0-44741b387b55",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eloquent and able with regards to speech."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee11697f-3371-4875-82c2-c56066f4473f",
                                                "sense_id": "d8771c5b-b5d1-3169-856f-89ca85404c1c",
                                                "text": "You give the well-spoken young man the time. The well-spoken young man, keeping well up with you, resumes: \"I am aware sir that it is a liberty to intrude a further question on a gentleman walking for his entertainment […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c295939-d80b-4a5c-98e1-cbb28b7db4dd",
                                                "sense_id": "d8771c5b-b5d1-3169-856f-89ca85404c1c",
                                                "text": "To get a minimum-wage employee, the company settled for a woman barely out of high school who was not well-spoken, and while she didn't cost much, the problem was that she was the first impression callers had of this multimillion dollar company."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8567f7fe-872a-4878-b494-d33d0ca30c1f",
                                                "sense_id": "d8771c5b-b5d1-3169-856f-89ca85404c1c",
                                                "text": "However well spoken a lawyer might be and however powerful an orator he may be, at the end the judge will make a decision based on legal statutes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59843fee-0632-443b-adcd-447b862d1a17",
                                                "sense_id": "d8771c5b-b5d1-3169-856f-89ca85404c1c",
                                                "text": "They've obviously never met before, but are getting on like a house on fire. Both are well-spoken and versed in the Queen's English."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
